            "displayName": "Uwe Schindler",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "One more thing, because Robert reminded me:\nI changed to use a LinkedHashSet instead simple HashSet, because the caller adding listeners would expect that they are called in order on close. Adding them to a HashSet makes they executed in arbitrary order and thats not what a user expects. The Linked* does not cost us much, as the number of listeners should be low :-)",
